(5. INCIDENT RESPONSE WORKFLOWS AND AUDIT REMEDIATION ROADMAP) '
() '
(The cybersecurity engineering council directs implementation of the) '
(following enterprise hardening protocols:) '
() '
(- Enforce Phishing-Resistant FIDO2/WebAuthn multi-factor) '
(authentication across all privileged access vectors.) '
() '
(- Deploy continuous Automated Red Team \(ART\) adversarial simulation) '
(agents across multi-cloud infrastructure.) '
() '
(- Implement dynamic data loss prevention \(DLP\) filters intercepting) '
(API payloads containing PII/PCI strings.) '
() '
(- Complete SOC 2 Type II, ISO 27001:2022, and FedRAMP High) '
(certification renewals annually.) '
() '
(- Maintain immutable append-only SIEM audit logs with 365-day) '
(retention in write-once-read-many \(WORM\) storage.) '
() '
ET

